Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 21:57:57 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] ios17: Bluetooth bring-up, battery service, RTC time, GPU
 preemption port (off) and probes

- Bluetooth: FuxiBluetooth (sheng BluetoothProbe port), firmware from the addon, WCN power votes, GENI UART/QUP DMA/GCC,
  HWIdentifiers nub (BCM4387 c2) for bluetoothd and BlueTool, /arm-io/bluetooth ADT node, patched bluetoothd build script
- Battery: ShengBattery/ShengBattmgr battery service
- FuxiButtons: RTC calendar offset kept in /private/var/db/fuxi-rtc-offset
- KeyStoreProbe: native_aks_device_id from /chosen/unique-chip-id (keychain software wrapping)
- GpuPowerProbe: two-ring preemption and the CP SMMU aperture from sheng; preemption off by default (sheng-gpu-preempt)
- FuxiCpuFreqLog: GPU preemption statistics; BootWatchdogPolicy: dictation prefs, TU_DEBUG file
